{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-solovay-function.md","title":"Solovay Function","display":"df-solovay-function — Solovay Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-solovay-function","aliases":["89-df-solovay-function"],"display":"df-solovay-function — Solovay Function","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[49-df-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-solovay-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-solovay-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-function — Solovay Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a href=\"?unresolved=49-df-linear-order\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-7\" data-link-target=\"49-df-linear-order\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">49-df-linear-order<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span> satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\)</span>, with distinguished start world <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_{0}\\in W\">\\(w_{0}\\in W\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}\">\\((W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}\\)</span> is a fixed linear ordering of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>, written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(w)=L_w\">\\(L(w)=L_w\\)</span>, is a fixed\nfamily of PA sentences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> is the\nprimitive-recursive proof-code relation represented by the object-language\nformula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)\\)</span> from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&amp;:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow W,\\\\\n\\sigma(0)&amp;\\coloneqq w_{0},\\\\\nC_n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{v\\in W\\mid\n\\sigma(n)Rv\\land\n\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec}C_n,&amp;C_n\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(n),&amp;C_n=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&amp;:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow W,\\\\\n\\sigma(0)&amp;\\coloneqq w_{0},\\\\\nC_n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{v\\in W\\mid\n\\sigma(n)Rv\\land\n\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec}C_n,&amp;C_n\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(n),&amp;C_n=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> : Solovay函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(n)\">\\(\\sigma(n)\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>步到达的世界</li>\n<li>该递归相对于所给句族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L_w)_{w\\in W}\">\\((L_w)_{w\\in W}\\)</span> 定义；句族与极限陈述之间的\n自指相容性属于后续对角化构造，不能在这里无说明地预设为“由\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 诱导”。</li>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 线性，每个非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span> 都有唯一\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>-最小元，所以递归逐步良定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)\\)</span> 是元层\n数值关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)\\)</span> 才是表示它的对象语言\n公式，二者不再混作函数类型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"49-df-linear-order","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[49-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ is the\nprimitive-recursive proof-code relation represented by the object-language\nformula $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)$ from\n[[89-df-provability-predicate]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)","display":false},{"tex":"w_{0}\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"(W,\\prec)\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"L(w)=L_w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow W,\\\\\n\\sigma(0)&\\coloneqq w_{0},\\\\\nC_n&\\coloneqq\n\\{v\\in W\\mid\n\\sigma(n)Rv\\land\n\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(n+1)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec}C_n,&C_n\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(n),&C_n=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"(L_w)_{w\\in W}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"C_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(n,\\ulcorner\\neg L_v\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y,x)","display":false}],"bytes":2034,"backlinks":[{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"070cc23caeb65b77","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]